# OneFP&A — platform parity for the toolchain (B18-8).
# All text files are LF in the index and stay LF in every working copy,
# so gate scripts, prettier, rustfmt and docs parsers behave identically
# on Windows / macOS / Linux. Binaries are excluded by git's auto-detection
# plus the explicit rules below.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.fpa binary
